{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263RoKYuKT6H1792681655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>寶潔上季收入好過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>截至9月底止第一季度，收入按年增長近百分之4，至232.8億美元，高過市場預期的228億美元。純利則微跌至47.3億美元。每股盈利1.97美元。</p><p></p><p>集團預測全年收入增長百分之2至4。核心每股盈利6.89至7.11美元，按年持平至上升百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.178166+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:38:00.177897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:14.791296+00:00","content_hash":"99b40f663becf2fe75faa4f6cae1437add256f8fa2595d691da9b7b6dac9bbcc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.178166+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}